  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h3>• About Our Brand and Products:</h3><p>Mila Brant is designed for self-expression through detail.<br>We create jewelry that feels personal, playful, and intentional — pieces that don’t just complete an outfit, but define it.</p><p>From delicate accents to bold statement designs, every piece is curated to capture attention while still feeling wearable. It’s jewelry people reach for daily — and get asked about every time they wear it.</p><hr><h3>• What Makes Us Different:</h3><p>We sit in the space between everyday wear and statement jewelry.</p><p>Our pieces are:</p><ul><li>Visually striking, but still easy to style</li><li>Trend-aware without feeling mass-produced</li><li>Designed to feel expressive, not generic</li></ul><p>Most jewelry blends in — ours becomes part of someone’s identity.<br>That’s why it naturally performs in content and drives organic interest.</p><hr><h3>• How Affiliates Can Earn:</h3><p>Affiliates earn commission on every sale driven through their custom link or code.</p><ul><li>Competitive commission structure</li><li>Strong AOV with multi-piece purchases</li><li>High repeat customer behavior</li><li>Frequent new drops to keep content fresh</li></ul><p>The model is simple: create content → drive clicks → earn consistently.</p><hr><h3>• How to Promote Us:</h3><p>Mila Brant performs best through aesthetic, lifestyle-driven content.</p><p>Top-performing formats:</p><ul><li>Close-up jewelry shots (texture, shine, detail)</li><li>“Get ready with me” (GRWM) content</li><li>Outfit styling with layered pieces</li><li>Hand/ear/neck-focused visuals</li><li>Soft, feminine, or playful storytelling</li></ul><p>The key is showing how the jewelry <em>feels</em> — not just how it looks.</p><hr><h3>• Other Information:</h3><ul><li>Quick and easy onboarding</li><li>Access to new collections early</li><li>Ongoing support for scaling creators</li><li>Long-term collaboration opportunities</li></ul><p>We’re building with creators who understand that jewelry isn’t just an accessory — it’s a signature.</p></div></div>",
